<title>USA: General Electric to raise pension benefits.</title>
<headline>General Electric to raise pension benefits.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON, D.C 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Union of Electrical Workers said Thursday that General Electric will increase pension benefits for more than 147,000 current retirees effective November 1.</p>
<p>Annual minimum pensions for GE pensioners will rise $10 to $30 for each year of service, with the biggest increases going to those who have been retired the longest.</p>
</text>
